      <div class="note mt-2">
        <strong>DDP routing in one line:</strong> ask your forwarder which Saudi port the DDP quote
        assumes. Jeddah suits western and central Saudi consignees; Dammam, then Riyadh Dry Port,
        suits Riyadh and Eastern Province. A cheaper quote that lands at the wrong port can become
        more expensive after long-haul trucking.
      </div>
